0,"Tamahaq, Tahaggart | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/thv/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..nmtKr85iV-N6otxL5e8T0WcEaQZxZ5hT2DHD1QHLc0E,"Tahaggart Tamahaq is an endangered indigenous language of Algeria, Libya, and Niger. It belongs to the Afro-Asiatic language family and is part of the Tamashek macrolanguage.","Tamahaq, Tahaggart",Afro-Asiatic
1,Tamahaq language,https://grokipedia.com/page/Tamahaq_language,"Tamahaq, also known as Tahaggart Tamahaq, is classified as a member of the Berber branch within the Afro-Asiatic language phylum.","Tamahaq, Tahaggart",Afro-Asiatic
